        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Andrew Deftereos of Leonard Wilson Keenan Estate Agents is delighted to present this fabulous apartment to the property market. It is a well maintained upgraded two-bedroom, one bathroom apartment that comes to market in excellent condition throughout, offering bright, spacious accommodation and is in a well-established residential development.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the property, you are welcomed by a warm and inviting entrance hallway which sets the tone for the well-maintained interior. To the back of the apartment are two good sized bedrooms with built-in cupboards. The full bathroom has been completely renovated and upgraded to a high standard.  \r\n\r\nOn the opposite side of the apartment you have a bright open plan area consisting of a modern kitchen, dining room and lounge which leads out onto a good sized balcony with a beautiful garden view. This area is flooded with good light having a Southerly aspect. The apartment is thoughtfully laid out and ideal for both everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe apartment comes with a dedicated underground parking and is close to the dart station and bus points providing excellent transport options. It has excellent access to amenities for shopping and restaurants and walking distance to Croke Park. It has easy access to the M50 Motorway and N3 National Road, providing convenient routes to the city center and beyond and being close to the Airport it is in a great location.\r\n\r\nThis apartment represents a fantastic opportunity to acquire a stylish and spacious apartment in sought-after Dublin 9 , ideal for first-time buyers, s, or investors alike.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThe features of this lovely home include:\r\n\r\n•             Upgraded bathroom\r\n\r\n•             Upgraded Kitchen          \r\n\r\n•             Underground parking\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
